    "name": "Zoomers Versus Boomers",
    "steam_appid": 3733100,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoomers versus Boomers is a player versus player game with two teams. The Zoomers, and the Boomers. The Zoomers outnumber the Boomers three to one, but each Zoomer that gets defeated becomes a Boomer. The only way for Zoomers win is to stay alive long enough for the clock to hit zero. Boomers, on the other hand, can win by defeating every Zoomer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Zoomers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoomers have a choice between three weapons. Prefer the long range? Use the slow firing but heavy hitting tablet. More of a medium range player? The spray of phones has you covered. Prefer to blast the Boomers yourself, close and personal? The fan of phones fits your style perfectly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733100/extras/98c7f5a0a86ddc7dd15a7568f146706a.avif?t=1749853086\" width=800 height=548 /></span>The Boomers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boomers one goal is to explode a Zoomer. To do that, they've got the ability to sprint and climb walls at frightening speeds. They can also charge their explosion, giving them greater range and damage the longer they hold onto it for. Though if they charge it for too long, they'll explode!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two unique maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoomers versus Boomers features two maps, a sprawling city with tall buildings and a metropolis full of speeding buses.  Players can vote on the map they want to play on every few rounds.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733100/extras/7872122677c8c43f9096cbd6537d8368.avif?t=1749853086\" width=366 height=316 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoomers versus Boomers is a player versus player game with two teams. The Zoomers, and the Boomers. The Zoomers outnumber the Boomers three to one, but each Zoomer that gets defeated becomes a Boomer. The only way for Zoomers win is to stay alive long enough for the clock to hit zero. Boomers, on the other hand, can win by defeating every Zoomer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Zoomers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoomers have a choice between three weapons. Prefer the long range? Use the slow firing but heavy hitting tablet. More of a medium range player? The spray of phones has you covered. Prefer to blast the Boomers yourself, close and personal? The fan of phones fits your style perfectly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733100/extras/98c7f5a0a86ddc7dd15a7568f146706a.avif?t=1749853086\" width=800 height=548 /></span>The Boomers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boomers one goal is to explode a Zoomer. To do that, they've got the ability to sprint and climb walls at frightening speeds. They can also charge their explosion, giving them greater range and damage the longer they hold onto it for. Though if they charge it for too long, they'll explode!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two unique maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoomers versus Boomers features two maps, a sprawling city with tall buildings and a metropolis full of speeding buses.  Players can vote on the map they want to play on every few rounds.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733100/extras/7872122677c8c43f9096cbd6537d8368.avif?t=1749853086\" width=366 height=316 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Ever wanted to explode your friends as a wheel chair bound old man? Now you can! In Zoomers Versus Boomers, the Zoomers try to avoid getting blown up for as long as possible. Hurl phones at your friends! Run as they converge on your position in a vast tidal wave of old men! Try not to explode!",
